2026-10-18T15:06:36.5343410Z -- Input staleness watchdog (item 12)
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5343844Z   ok   a fresh sensor reads normally
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5344245Z   ok   an over-age value is rejected
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5344617Z   ok   the rejected value is still available for a graceful fallback
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5345132Z   ok   the age is reported so a user can see why
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5345669Z   ok   an outdoor reading may be older than an indoor one
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5346343Z   ok   the watchdog can be switched off entirely
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5347071Z   ok   the age limit can be relaxed
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5347658Z   ok   a future-stamped state is stale, not age 0
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5348064Z   ok   a 4 h backward host-clock step flags the reading stale
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5348518Z   ok   unavailable is distinguished from stale
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5348863Z   ok   a missing entity is reported as such
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5349258Z   ok   an unconfigured input is not a problem
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5349587Z   ok   a non-numeric state does not raise
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5349964Z   ok   a non-finite state string is refused exactly like a word
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5350386Z   ok   a non-finite value is refused after unit conversion too
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5350941Z   ok   the °F path itself keeps working (null control for the guard above)
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5351391Z   ok   an untimestamped state is used rather than discarded
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5351742Z   ok   stale inputs are listed
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5352032Z   ok   missing inputs are listed
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5352319Z   ok   the summary is human-readable
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5352612Z   ok   the evidence names the entity
2026-10-18T15:06:36.5352913Z   ok   the failing entity ids are listed
