2026-10-18T15:06:36.6165076Z   ok   the inferred estimator reads a real defrost as a PERFECT interval
2026-10-18T15:06:36.6165276Z   ok   an over-1 ratio can no longer park the derate above 1.0
2026-10-18T15:06:36.6165463Z   ok   five defrosting minutes in thirty is a duty of 1/6
